    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d176-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d176-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Johnson Library, National Security File, Country File, Germany, vol. 11.
                    Confidential. Drafted by Puhan and
                    approved in the White House by Bromley Smith on December 2. The meeting was held
                    at the White House. McGhee discussed
                        Erhard’s visit in <hi
                        rendition="#italic">At the Creation of a New Germany</hi>, pp. 190–193,
                    199–200. President Johnson discussed the
                    visit and its background in <hi rendition="#italic">The Vantage Point</hi>, pp.
                    306–308.</p>
            </note>
