                <p>At their 11 a.m. meeting; see <ref target="frus1964-68v13#d207">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1964–1968, vol. XIII,
                        Document 207</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
